    <item>
      <title>To the editor: U.S. looks more like North Korea right now</title>
      <link>https://www.toledoblade.com/opinion/letters-to-the-editor/2026/01/29/forum-us-north-korea-ice-videos-protests-trump-sports/stories/20260129021</link>
      <description>I always enjoyed history in school. The rise and fall of dynasties stuck out to me. From the Ming Dynasty to the Roman Empire and having the sun never setting on the British Empire, history is undefeated. None of these lasted forever. We can all agree that the United States is on top now. Do we think that we’re so great that we can defy history? Something knocks empires off their pedestals at some point. The question is, how long will they be on top?</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toledoblade.com/opinion/letters-to-the-editor/2026/01/29/forum-us-north-korea-ice-videos-protests-trump-sports/stories/20260129021</guid>
